// # Columnar Analytics, Parquet & Arrow Storage Subsystem Facade
//
// Logline: Unified standard library facade for Apache Parquet codecs, Apache Arrow vectors, compression, and vectorized query operators.
//
// Setup: Master entry point importing and re-exporting all 50 columnar analytics, Parquet file format, and Arrow array subsystems.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import Parquet codecs, Arrow in-memory arrays, vectorized operators, and analytics submodules.
//   2. Re-export public constructors and convenient facade helpers for columnar processing.
//   3. Maintain unified standard library interface for high-performance analytical database systems.

